ses Attack by 15% and Crit by 30%, lasts 1 turn, and each draws 1 card)."}}],"debateSouls":[],"soulPoints":{"war":5300,"battle":5600,"debate":3200},"equipment":[{"id":"WP1004602","name":{"zh":"精铁剑","en":"Refined Iron Sword"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"采用了质量较好的铁冶炼的长剑。","en":"A longsword forged from higher-quality iron."},"atkVal":"5","price":"2000","slot":{"zh":"武器","en":"Weapon"}},{"id":"WP1006705","name":{"zh":"鱼鳞甲·丙","en":"Scale Armor - III"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"将串连的绳索隐藏在甲片下面，由层层相扣的钢甲片组成，一层遮一层的构造极似鱼鳞，是一种高级甲胄。","en":"Steel plates layered one over another like fish scales with binding cords hidden beneath. A high-grade armor of sophisticated construction."},"defenceVal":"6","price":"2400","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1023105","name":{"zh":"铁胄·甲","en":"Iron Helm - I"},"level":"0","description":{"zh":"最简易的头盔，在士兵与伍长之间最为常见。","en":"The simplest helmet, most common among soldiers and squad leaders."},"defenceVal":"2","price":"800","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}}],"family":{},"clans":[{"id":"GI114115","name":{"zh":"南中雍氏","en":"The Yong Clan of Nanzhong"},"years":["0","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自西汉什邡侯雍齿的后裔。雍齿是汉高祖刘邦的仇人，但后被封侯，其家族的一支南迁至益州郡，历经两汉，成为“恩信著于南土”的南中首屈一指的汉族大姓。雍闿被吕凯称为“先君雍侯”之后，是南中大姓中门户最高、最具政治号召力的家族。刘备去世后，雍闿杀太守正昂、擒继任太守张裔，联合夷帅高定、牂牁太守朱褒起兵反蜀，并投靠孙吴，被孙权遥授为永昌太守。后因内讧被高定部曲所杀。","en":"Descended from Yong Chi, the Marquis of Shifang during the Western Han. Though an old adversary of Emperor Gaozu of Han, Yong Chi was later enfeoffed as a marquis, and a branch of his family migrated south to Yi Province Commandery. Spanning both Han dynasties, they grew into the foremost Han clan in Nanzhong, renowned for ‘benevolence and integrity across the southern lands’. Yong Kai was hailed by Lu Kai as a descendant of ‘our late lord, Marquis Yong’, standing atop the most prestigious and politically influential house among the great clans of Nanzhong. Following Liu Bei's passing, Yong Kai slew Governor Zheng Ang and captured his successor Zhang Yi, joining forces with the tribal chieftain Gao Ding and Governor of Zangke Zhu Bao to rebel against Shu. Pledging allegiance to Sun Wu, he was nominally appointed Governor of Yongchang by Sun Quan. He was later slain by Gao Ding's retainers amidst internal strife."},"talent":{"military":"6","commerce":"2","politics":"4"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":null,"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1022","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[73,75,57,56,41,60],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1006705","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1022","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[73,75,57,56,41,60],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1006705","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10615","name":{"zh":"十常侍之乱","en":"Turmoil of the Ten Attendants"},"year":"188","month":"11"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1022","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[73,75,57,56,41,60],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1006705","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10402","name":{"zh":"诸侯讨董","en":"Coalition Against Dong Zhuo"},"year":"190","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1022","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[73,75,57,56,41,60],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1006705","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10208","name":{"zh":"幽燕龙兴","en":"Dragon 